7. SMART RENAMING

Where useful, rename badly named files into a consistent format.

Preferred format:

"YYYY-MM-DD_Category_Subject_Description"

Examples:

"2026-08-25_Bank_SBI_CreditCard_Statement.pdf"

"2026-09-10_Legal_Property_Court_Order.pdf"

"2026-09-18_Invoice_Amazon_Order-12345.pdf"

"2026-09-20_Photo_Family_Event.jpg"

However:

Never rename a file if doing so could break an application, reference, synchronization process, or document relationship.

Do not rename files inside protected application/system directories unless explicitly authorized.

