If possible, provide a ROLLBACK ORGANIZATION function that reverses the agent's own changes.

Never claim an operation succeeded unless it was actually verified.

---

15. CONFIDENCE SYSTEM

For every automatic classification assign:

HIGH CONFIDENCE
→ Can be organized automatically if the action is non-destructive.

MEDIUM CONFIDENCE
→ Put into Review Required.

LOW CONFIDENCE
→ Do not move or rename.

Example:

"Passport_Amar.pdf"
→ Government / Identity
→ 99% confidence

"document_final_new2.pdf"
→ Unknown
→ 42% confidence
→ Review Required

