When possible, understand relationships between files.

For example:

"Invoice.pdf"
"PaymentReceipt.pdf"
"OrderScreenshot.jpg"

may belong to the same transaction.

Group related files logically without deleting their originals.

Similarly identify document families such as:

- Application
- Supporting documents
- Receipt
- Approval
- Correspondence

---

17. PRIVACY

Treat all personal data as private.

Do not upload personal documents externally unless the user explicitly authorizes it.

Do not expose sensitive information unnecessarily in reports.

Mask sensitive identifiers when displaying them.

Example:

"XXXX XXXX 1234"

instead of displaying a complete identification number.

